# e3m4 E1 "e3m4_return" (docs/design/mission-e3-04.md, Cinematic hooks): ~21 s, mode=pause over the live mission (the
# spec's HOLD runs as PAUSE until the player supports HOLD). The Evenmead by day, three days after e3m2: north = -Z = the
# ridge and the Dusk Keep (-12, -48), Malrik at (-6, -40), Torvald at his post (40, -24); the river at z ~0; Lark Hill's
# crest to the south, where Vey rests (-4, 34.8). 1) WIDE crane from the east bank: the trampled valley, the black fords,
# the spoiled wagons on Lark Hill (L1); 2) MS Torvald and MS Malrik (the spec's two-shot at the keep door is two singles:
# in the live mission they stand 46 m apart; both orbit the live units, tags `torvald` and `malrik`) (L2-L3); 3) long lens
# south: on Lark Hill's crest a lone old figure, a storm cloud forming above him (L4 over it). Cameras east of the
# Malrik - Ysolde line (the Ep3 rule). Lines: L1-L4 (mission DIALOGUE, French in campaign.po).
# End state (MissionE304._intro): camera on Malrik, L1-L4, the start hint.
cine e3m4_return  title="The Return"  mode=pause  letterbox=2.39  seed=62  length=19..23
env day  moon_yaw=210  moon_pitch=-28  energy=0.85
cast  malrik    res://art/units/wizards/malrik.tscn  at=(-6, 0, -40)  yaw=160
cast  torvald   res://art/units/wizards/torvald.tscn  at=(40, 0, -24)  yaw=250
cast  narrator  capsule  at=(0, 0, -300)  hidden=1

# WIDE crane from the east bank: the trampled valley, the black fords, the spoiled wagons on the hill
shot R1 7.0  cam=crane  from=(44, 20, -8)  to=(38, 13, -4)  look=(0, 0, 8)>(-4, 0, 14)  fov=56>50  in=fade_black:0.8
  at 0.0  sfx res://assets/audio/forge/sfx/evenmead_amb.wav  vol=-12
  at 0.4  line narrator "Three days later. Malrik came back from Duskbarrow to a ridge that smelled of thunder."
# MS Torvald at his post, frost on his beard
shot R2 6.0  cam=orbit  pivot=torvald  r=3.6  h=1.7  deg=10>18
  at 0.3  line torvald "Every dusk the old man walks down to the river and looks at us. Then he walks away."
  at 0.3  sfx res://assets/audio/forge/sfx/ice_creak.wav  vol=-14
# MS Malrik at the Dusk Keep, 3/4-left
shot R3 3.0  cam=orbit  pivot=malrik  r=3.4  h=1.6  deg=25>30  fov=38
  at 0.3  line malrik "Looks. Not crosses?"
# Long lens south up Lark Hill: a lone old figure on the crest, a storm cloud gathering above him
shot R4 5.5  cam=dolly  from=(8, 3.5, -20)  to=(7.6, 3.6, -19)  look=(-4, 3, 34.8)>(-4, 4, 34.8)  fov=16>14
  at 0.2  line torvald "Not yet. I think he was waiting for you. He is polite like that."
  at 1.6  vfx cloud  scene=res://art/cinematics/fx/umbral_shroud.tscn  at=(-4, 9, 34.8)  life=3.6  scale=1.2
  at 2.4  sfx res://assets/audio/sfx/atk_storm.wav  vol=-18
  at 4.9  fade alpha=1 time=0.6
